    "northStar": "Estudio cercano",
    "overview": "Estudio cercano pairs expressive editorial headings with direct, readable service copy. Lavender paper, plum ink and a restrained violet accent make the site feel approachable and professional; the existing mate logo provides the local identity.\n\nOpen sections, fine dividing rules and softly rounded actions carry the design. This record describes the current homepage implementation in src/styles/launch.css and src/app/[locale]/page.tsx, with inherited global behavior checked in globals.css.",
